THIS DEED is made on the twelfth day of March between Harold Finch of 14 Mill Lane, the Seller, and Beatrice Okoro of 3 Chapel Row, the Buyer.

WHEREAS the Seller is the registered proprietor of the freehold land known as Plot 7, Mill Lane, which land is subject to a right of way in favour of the owner of Plot 6;

AND WHEREAS the Seller has agreed to sell the said land to the Buyer for the sum of two hundred and forty thousand pounds;

NOW THIS DEED WITNESSES that in consideration of the sum of two hundred and forty thousand pounds paid by the Buyer to the Seller, the Seller, being the registered proprietor of the freehold land known as Plot 7, Mill Lane, which land is subject to a right of way in favour of the owner of Plot 6, hereby transfers the said land to the Buyer.

Signed and delivered as a deed on the date first written above.
